     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Man, there are not a lot of resting places in this hub...",
       "transl": "Meeensch ey, hier gibt's kaum Plätze zum Ausruhen."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "What? \\.\\.\\. There is one right over to the left?",
       "transl": "Was?\\.\\.\\. Da drüben ist noch einer frei?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "But it is so small...",
       "transl": "Ach, viel zu klein..."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "That's some quality A first world problem you got there.",
       "transl": "Deine Sorgen möcht' ich haben."
